      "source_hash": "sha256:36e6d01121fa965882c7328ed5aec9cbf0d1195685c92c050160816d5f45976a",
      "source_text": "By anticipating possible complications and recognizing early warning signs, we can often prevent the development of critical situations. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "通过预见可能的并发症并识别早期预警信号，我们通常可以防止危急情况的发展。→？（芬兰语）",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "provider": "deepseek_2",
