      "source_hash": "sha256:f93c658aa723cf7f15f38aa8e42277287d1862baccdf9f6a2669b80714a9d28c",
      "source_text": "In intercultural nursing, it is important to be aware of our own prejudices and strive to understand factors related to the patient's background without making assumptions based on generalizations. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "在跨文化护理中，重要的是要意识到我们自己的偏见，并努力理解与患者背景相关的因素，而不基于概括做出假设。 ->? (in Finnish)",
