      "source_hash": "sha256:98aef1ac1b5bcef3fd3778f2b5474297a1bb1119c2a35c1b274a0875973a5d16",
      "source_text": "In palliative care, it is important to distinguish between treatment that relieves symptoms and improves quality of life, and treatment that is already futile and may cause unnecessary suffering to the patient. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "在姑息治疗中，重要的是要区分缓解症状、改善生活质量的治疗和已经无效并可能给患者带来不必要痛苦的治疗。",
