      "source_text": "Respecting patient autonomy means that even if we would not make the same choice ourselves, we must accept the patient's decision as long as they have received sufficient information and understand the consequences of their decision. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "尊重患者自主权意味着，即使我们自己不会做出同样的选择，只要患者已获得充分信息并理解其决定的后果，我们就必须接受患者的决定。 ->? (in Finnish)",
