      "source_hash": "sha256:e4204e297d5191f90f5d451280ace40e444cbd023592c0d46466cf6606167c17",
      "source_text": "The professional role of a nurse includes acting as the patient's voice in situations where the patient themselves cannot express their wishes or needs in decision-making regarding treatment. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "护士的专业角色包括在病人本人无法就治疗决策表达其意愿或需求的情况下，充当病人的代言人。",
