      "source_hash": "sha256:0185bc2e22bc091ff58c3f5c79b6f7b46fbd4b631eb8486ba9ed55b7ed7d55b7",
      "source_text": "Nurses have a unique position to influence health policy because they work close to patients and see concretely how political decisions affect access to care, quality, and staff well-being. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "护士在影响卫生政策方面具有独特的地位，因为他们与患者密切接触，并能具体看到政治决策如何影响护理的可及性、质量和员工福祉。",
