      "source_hash": "sha256:9084829212c65a39d1cd5cc0cd76cbd633cac660c758d81f7491716f294f9809",
      "source_text": "Technology should be a tool that frees up the nurse's time for interaction and clinical reasoning, not an end in itself that increases workload and diverts attention away from the patient. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "技术应该是一种工具，解放护士的时间用于互动和临床推理，而不是本身成为增加工作量、分散对患者注意力的目的。",
