      "source_hash": "sha256:0c2c71bd2a85c1a6e362eb65333f81c9b74843b869e8518142dd02b804b68d2f",
      "source_text": "In trauma-informed care, it is essential to understand that patient behavior we might consider challenging can be a consequence of previous traumatic experiences, and the care environment must strengthen safety and a sense of control. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "在创伤知情护理中，必须理解患者可能被视为具有挑战性的行为可能是先前创伤经历的结果，并且护理环境必须加强安全感和控制感。",
