      "source_text": "In preventing burnout, the key factors are adequate recovery after a shift, a sense of control over one's work and the ability to influence it, as well as peer support provided by the work community. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "zh-Hans",
      "localized_text": "在预防职业倦怠方面，关键因素包括轮班后充分的恢复、对工作掌控感及影响力、以及工作团队提供的同伴支持。→?（芬兰语）",
